ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌巨资挽留失败</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney跨界医疗领域，推出集成超声芯片的全身扫描仪设备</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持与通话交互功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里开源多领域科学生成基础模型LOGOS，统一异构科学数据编码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1bc875d1e963cfbae78a451e577f1de8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月18日，阿里ATH-Token Foundry联合中国人民大学高瓴人工智能学院正式开源LOGOS多领域科学生成基础模型。该模型通过设计共享词表，将蛋白质、抗体、小分子及MOF材料等异构对象统一编码为离散Token序列，摆脱了对昂贵3D空间信息的依赖，实现了跨学科数据的底层知识共享。在参数效率方面，LOGOS-1B版本仅用1/56的参数量，在多项科学任务中超越微软NatureLM。该模型解决了预训练与下游任务的目标偏差，无需繁琐微调即可直接激活生成能力。目前，LOGOS已构建包含7类模态、总计44.87B tokens的预训练语料库。项目组已在HuggingFace与GitHub开源模型权重、推理代码及技术报告，旨在降低科研开发门槛，为多模态科学大模型提供统一的技术范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">演语科技完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，估值超20亿美元且ARR突破3亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5e735455b3801bbc6f86372d7af63e1c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">演语科技（Evoken）近日完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，投后估值超20亿美元，由Granite Asia、腾讯、顺为资本联合领投。截至2026年5月，公司ARR已突破3亿美元，5月整体收入同比增长超3000%，核心收入源于短剧、影视及广告等专业内容生产者的真实预算。演语科技已构建三条核心产品线：拥有超3000万用户的AI图片创作社区LiblibAI、服务近千个团队的AI视频创作平台LibTV，以及服务超千万用户的AI设计Agent“星流”。三者串联起素材、生产到交付的完整AI内容链路。此次融资后，演语科技凭借超3亿美元的ARR跻身全球AI内容赛道第一梯队，其跨场景整合能力标志着AI应用正从单纯比拼生成质量，转向比拼工作流生产链路的深水区，为全球AI商业化落地提供了中国样本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌巨资挽留失败</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Transformer架构核心作者、人工智能领域顶尖研究员Noam Shazeer近日正式宣布加入OpenAI。Shazeer曾是谷歌Gemini项目的技术负责人，此前谷歌曾斥资约27亿美元通过技术许可协议将其召回，但此次挽留未能成功。作为《Attention Is All You Need》论文的主要作者，Shazeer被业界誉为“巫师”，其发明的Transformer架构是现代LLM的核心基石。这是Shazeer第二次离开谷歌，此前他曾离职创办Character.AI。随着此次变动，Transformer论文的八位核心作者已全部离开谷歌，其中两人现已入职OpenAI。Shazeer的加入将显著增强OpenAI的研发实力，进一步加剧科技巨头间的人才竞争，并可能对Gemini后续的技术迭代产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney跨界医疗领域，推出集成超声芯片的全身扫描仪设备</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/657c7a80890c9b5539af8df4d9b02e9d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI图像生成平台Midjourney正式跨界医疗健康领域，推出首款硬件产品Midjourney Scanner。该设备由Midjourney与超声技术公司Butterfly Network合作开发，每套系统集成40个超声芯片成像模块。用户站入浅水池后，系统通过环形结构内数千个换能器发射超声波，在约60秒内利用高达2 PFLOPS的算力重建高精度体内三维影像，成像质量旨在媲美核磁共振。Midjourney计划于2027年底前在旧金山开设配套体检水疗中心并部署约10台设备。目前该项目处于早期测试阶段，团队现阶段聚焦于身体构成图，暂不涉及医疗诊断功能，未来若用于诊断需通过美国FDA审批。该设备提供无辐射、便捷的内部成像体验，旨在让用户更自由地获取身体数据，公司承诺在正式落地前公布详尽的数据政策。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持与通话交互功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正在为其AI助手Claude进行语音模式的重大迭代，核心在于打破语言壁垒并优化交互逻辑。根据iOS版Claude应用设置界面显示，该功能将新增对中文、粤语、日语、德语、西班牙语、葡萄牙语、俄语及乌克兰语的支持，彻底改变此前仅支持英语的现状。在交互模式上，Claude新增了“按下通话”模式，用户需长按按钮进行语音输入，并保留了支持连续对话的“免提”模式。此外，应用界面中出现的电话听筒图标暗示，Anthropic正致力于打造更接近传统语音通话的即时交互体验。此次更新旨在提升Claude在多语言环境下的可用性，使AI对话更自然、更具自主权。虽然目前相关功能仍处于酝酿阶段，但这一布局标志着Claude在语音交互领域迈向更深度的场景化应用，将显著改善非英语母语用户的交互体验。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
